# Re-writer Environment Configuration
# =====================================
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your values

# Google OAuth Client ID
# -----------------------
# To enable cloud sync with Google Drive:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Create a new project (or use existing)
# 3. Enable the Google Drive API
# 4. Go to "Credentials" and create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID
# 5. Set application type to "Web application"
# 6. Add your domain to "Authorized JavaScript origins"
#    - For local development: http://localhost:5173
#    - For production: https://your-domain.com
# 7. Copy the Client ID here
#
# Note: This is completely FREE! Users store data in their own Google Drive.
# You pay nothing - each user uses their own 15GB quota.

VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
